{% comment %}
  Line helper — single source of truth for the FREDJO / NAC split.

  Reads the product metafield custom.line and echoes a flag:
    - "true"  when custom.line == "nac"
    - "false" otherwise (empty metafield, "fredjo", or anything else)

  Because {% render %} runs in an isolated scope, callers capture the output
  and compare it to the string "true":

    {%- capture is_nac -%}{%- render 'line-helpers', product: product -%}{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- assign is_nac = is_nac | strip -%}
    {%- if is_nac == 'true' -%} ... NAC treatment ... {%- endif -%}

  Defaulting to "false" guarantees every product renders exactly as today
  until the merchant fills custom.line in the admin.

  Parameters:
    - product (required): product object
{% endcomment %}
{%- liquid
  assign line_value = product.metafields.custom.line.value | default: '' | downcase | strip
  if line_value == 'nac'
    echo 'true'
  else
    echo 'false'
  endif
-%}
